":0.4176470588235294,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":30117,\"title\":\"Anything for Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fG2Dz7HBQymhKNu1dQ3H5bH7O1h.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.415625,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":108406,\"title\":\"O Noivo É Que Sabe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nEWHjCCyNcfmBULjxsdozKy9jiF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4154639175257732,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":67193,\"title\":\"Undressed\",\"poster\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41515151515151516,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":72463,\"title\":\"Love Island: Aftersun\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/96Wayp51dwwplcAVP8G2AHV6mOM.jpg\",\"rating\":3.4,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41445783132530123,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Season 6\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xDOqmSsOnw0CqfDcKypdHDUk3Xa.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2018-08-15\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-15\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"The first single date of the series sees one lucky Bachelorette join Bachelor, Nick on a secluded beach where he pulls out all the stops to impress. Later, the claws come out on a group date.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-16\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Tension starts to boil over in the mansion as alliances are formed and rivalries strengthen. Meanwhile, some of the Bachelorettes are starting to fall for the Honey Badger’s charms.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-22\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"A chemistry fuelled fly-fishing date sets one bachelorette apart as some cheeky flirtation and an honest conversation brings the two closer together.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-23\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Sparks fly between Nick and one of the lucky bachelorettes that he picks for a fun and romantic speedboat date. Plus, surprise guests arrive for the group date.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-29\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"When Nick takes one lucky woman on a date, there is love in the air. Get ready for Romy’s bedtime visit on a camping trip with Nick. What is she getting up to?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-08-30\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"The intruders are here and, boy oh boy, they bring the drama. But the drama doesn’t stop there. Later at the cocktail party, the claws really come out, causing chaos and a runaway Bachelorette.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-05\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"The Bachelorettes compete for some alone time with Nick on a group date, and a single date announcement leaves one particular Bachelorette reeling.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-06\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"On a group date, the ladies participate in a lie detector test. What is Brooke’s big secret?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-12\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"With each rose ceremony and cocktail party, it gets harder and harder. If you thought being the Bachelor was easy, think again. Who will break the Honey Badger’s heart?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-13\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-19\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"Tension among the girls is brewing, with long-held resentment and jealousy running high.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-20\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 13\",\"overview\":\"The girls go on a 1950s-inspired bowling date with Nick, who is hoping to sort out the hot strikes from the gutter balls. Emotions run high when the girls write a letter to their future self in 2028.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-26\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 14\",\"overview\":\"It’s a hometown week like no other. Nick will answer some tough questions and meet the dad from hell. Later, tempers flare at an intense cocktail party.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-27\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 15\",\"overview\":\"With feelings escalating and the final just around the corner, Nick needs to decide who he wants to meet his family. All three women lay their emotions on the line, but who will make it to the final?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-03\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Finale\",\"overview\":\"In this spectacular season finale, Nick’s incredible journey to love reaches its dramatic conclusion in tropical New Caledonia. Who will he choose to be with?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-10-04\",\"runtime\":60}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2013-09-08\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}